commit 772a1671972a298d95bc5d05c8d83f70b6718b04

C03: memory completion composes against the request text; quoted remembered value; memory_disabled hint (MEMORY1253 repair)

MEMORY1251 measured three causes: English requests got Spanish finals
because the memory continuation carried only the public objective (null for
memory-only requests); the composer translated observed.remembered («red»
became «rojo»); and the memory_disabled failure message restated the datum
as remembered and called the save an operation (forbidden term) until the
retries ran out. The continuation now carries the request text, the payload
check requires the remembered value verbatim, and the failure hint says only
that nothing was saved because the private memory is off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


